    "turn_idx": 50,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, I think it's worth a debate for sure. And I hate to give you that middle of the road answer. No, that's fair. I've heard from people on both sides. And at the end of the day, we have a much bigger problem in Washington, which is that People in DC believe that it's their money. When in fact, that is all our money, we the people. And until we can really break ourselves to that mindset, there's no way that we're going to be able to fix any program.",
